hs of history, profitable in 81% of months, worst drop -6%, skill score 3.5.\n- **They opened** a new PUMP long at $0.0048 ($35,045) at 09:14 UTC. Price when we saw it: $0.0048.\n\n### The checks (the thinking)\n- \u2705 **Trend:** PUMP is above its 50-day average and BTC is above its 50-day average. A long (betting up) trade goes with the market.\n- \u2705 **Not late:** Price moved +0.12% in the trader's favor before we could copy \u2014 small enough, we are not chasing.\n- \u2705 **Conviction:** Trader put in $35,045, 1.6\u00d7 their usual new-trade size \u2014 a real bet.\n- \u2705 **Calm enough:** Price swings are 1.0\u00d7 normal for PUMP \u2014 fine.\n- \u2705 **Enough trading:** $107.7M traded in the last day \u2014 easy to get in and out.\n- \u274c **Kronos:** 1 of 8 Kronos forecasts agree with the trade (average move next 24h -4.81%) \u2014 Kronos disagrees.\n\n### What each practice version did\n- **1 Copy every trade:** TOOK IT \u2014 copies every main-team trade\n- **2 + emergency pause & stand-in:** TOOK IT \u2014 trader is in good form\n- **3 + trade check:** skipped \u2014 failed the trade check: Kronos\n- **4 + really-good while paused:** skipped \u2014 failed the trade check: Kronos\n- **5 Copy every trade + scale out:** TOOK IT \u2014 copies every main-team trade\n- **6 Copy every trade + stop-and-reverse:** TOOK IT \u2014 copies every main-team trade\n- **7 REGIME (adapts to the market):** TOOK IT \u2014 CHOPPY market \u2014 scale out exits, size x0.5\n\n### The plan (set before entering)\n- Entry \u2248 $0.0048. Risk: $0.85 (1% of the $85 account).\n- **Stop-loss $0.0047** (3.3% away = 1.5\u00d7 the usual hourly swing). If hit, the idea was wrong \u2014 we're out.\n- At +1\u00d7 risk ($0.0050) the stop moves to break-even.\n- After +2\u00d7 risk the stop trails 1\u00d7 risk behind the best price.\n- **Take-profit $0.0053** (3\u00d7 the risk). One win like this pays for three losses.\n\n### How to spot this yourself\n> Warning signs here: **Kronos**. Even good traders take trades like this \u2014 the lesson is to notice these signs *before* you click buy, and pass."}], "started": "2026-10-21 04:27:00.356637"}